# Pages colocation (vcl-forntend)

```
src/app/pages/<role>/<feature>/
  page.jsx
  components/
```

Roles: `auth` | `admin` | `sales` | `operations`.

- `page.jsx` mỏng; domain từ `@/modules/<feature>`.
- Path: `ROUTES` trong `appRoutes.js`.
- Shared ≥2 khu vực → `src/app/components/`.
